ation in this market**, so any Sarajevo salon list needs screening against it or you'll burn calls on salons already served. Second, the genuinely unserved salons here are **Instagram-only businesses with no website** — a real segment, but qualifying them means checking Instagram bios and calling, not fetching sites. If that segment interests you, I'd suggest a different approach targeting it directly rather than more directory searching, which is tapped out."
